OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly dry
OL,6,Fand bright evening but showery rain
OL,7,Freaching the Western Isles. The south
OL,8,Fand east of Highland will stay dry
OL,9,Fovernight with some clear intervals,
OL,10,Fwhile cloud and showery rain spreads
OL,11,Ffurther into the west.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FThe Isles and Northwest
OL,14,FHighlands will be cloudy with showery
OL,15,Frain, some heavy. East Highland
OL,16,Fbrighter with sunny intervals and a
OL,17,Ffew showers, and becoming very warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
