OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FFurther showers on Thursday,
OL,7,Fespecially northwest, but very warm in
OL,8,Feast. Bright spells and a few showers
OL,9,Fon Friday and Saturday, turning cooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
